    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sangala jowotin makiweno wiwegi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wan ma wategino i yeyo waripo konyo joma nyap gi tiŋo bieto pajo. Kiripi ka wawegi wamiyere kisangala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kucel, ŋat'acel acele kwoŋ wan ripo miyo jager pere kisangala ma konyo go, ŋey wodongi ŋato i yeyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.69.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 69:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole Kristo won k'omiyere kisangala. Kucel, obedo paka ondiki ni, “Yet ma jono joyetin gine omakan ayino.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole gimoro je m'ondiki i kitawo maleŋ ondiki ma fonjo wan, ŋey walimi geno i diyo cuny kodi i meni ma Ndiko Maleŋ miyo wan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Weyi Were ma jadiy cuny ji kendo jadwoki meni, womiy winyal bedo kanyacel i siem, munyo wiluwo ranen pa Yesu Kristo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka nyaka wijoje kanyacel, gi dwondi win acel, winyal pako Were kodi Ba Yesu Kristo Rwodhiwan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wac Manyen Maber ri Jopath",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Am'omiyo jolere win paka Kristo ojolo wan, ma miyo Were dwoŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole awaco riwin ni Kristo olokere jatic pa jom'othumere (Joyuda) ma nyutho nike Were genere, ma miyo cikirok pa Were m'otimo gi kwarere wan wotundi i kare, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.22.50"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 22:50",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.18.50"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 18:50",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bende gi miyo Jopath pako Were ro wor pere, paka ndiko waco ni,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Atoŋa m'omiyo Paulo ondiko gi miseni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wutmera, awon anitie gi geno kwoŋ win, nike withoth gi bero, nike wipoŋ gi rieko, aka wiwegi winyalo fonjo jowoti win. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To kad'ameno, i balwa m'atieko ndiko riwin, abedo gi miseni kwoŋ gigipiny moro ma apoyo win, ro nema ma Were opokan ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ma bedo jatic pa Kristo Yesu ma tiyo ri Jopath. Atiyo paka jacway ri Were i migam kareno atito Wac Manyen Maber ma wok bongi Were, ŋey Jopath jowobedi mic ma Were jolo, ma Cuny Maleŋ olonyo rigo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Am'omiyo, i Kristo Yesu, anyalo bedo g'atoŋa ma yumirok gi tic paran ri Were. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka akibino yumirok gi giman makiweno gima Kristo otieko timo munyo oran i miyo Jopath winjo Were, gi wac kodi tim, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gi meni ma wok'iye ranyuth kodi gir'aura, gi meni pa Cuny Maleŋ pa Were. Gino omiyo kama awoth'iye je, cako Yerusalem tundo Ilirikam, atieko tito Wac Manyen Maber kwoŋ Kristo kicutho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Am'omiyo gim'asa yenyo timo obedo tito Wac Manyen Maber kama fodi k'owinj'iye kwoŋ Kristo, ŋey akir'alwowere kwoŋ tic ma ŋatiman otieko cako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.52.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 52:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato ndiko waco ni,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paulo cano kidho wendo yu Roma",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.1.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 1:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meno a gim'onwaŋo omonan ndir madit bino bongi win. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To paka acowo tic paran iy'adec me, odoko paka atieko yenyo bino neno win oro mathoth, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "onyo ageno timo ameno pama. Amito neno win ka amako royo ma kidho yu Sipeyin, winyal konyan i nger ma kidho koro, k'atieko ye kisangala i liewo win hongo m'oromo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.16.1+1CO.16.2+1CO.16.3+1CO.16.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kor 16:1-4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gunyo ni, akidho Yerusalem tiyo ri ji pa Were koro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole kitipa pa jom'oyeyo ma Makedonia kodi piny pa Jogris joridho paro ma miyo mic ma konyo jocandi i dier ji pa Were ma Yerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.9.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kor 9:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo wegi joridho timo ameno; aka i adieri joripo konyo jo; kole Joyuda jopoko silwany pajo kodi Jopath, am'omiyo Jopath bende joripo konyo Joyuda gi silwany pajo ma gigipiny ma piny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "K'acowo tic me, kareno atieko tero rijo pesa m'ocoki rijo, nyaka abino mako yo ma kidho Sipeyin, t'aliewo win k'akidho yukorago. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "K'abino bongi win, aŋeyo ni alabino gi silwany pa Kristo m'opoŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:29"
          },
